","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"0499d714e8968657eda15c591c8a7751b740f80c18a4545d7e901d78b82b6e6d","event_uuid":"b83d411f-077d-4ba3-888e-665dbc293cc8","position":{"commit_sha":"16af6741ff151fb2433599382010c95f669241bb","position":"1785551086944345001-b83d411f-077d-4ba3-888e-665dbc293cc8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"f310edd9050793249286d1d44a45b2ef5fe5429e0bccdd0586a11c36456b790f","event_uuid":"6d8bf06b-77e0-4eca-800e-1f6d54352f3a","position":{"commit_sha":"16af6741ff151fb2433599382010c95f669241bb","position":"1785551087635965001-6d8bf06b-77e0-4eca-800e-1f6d54352f3a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1785533068650690001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"4e8d7635-5b3d-48eb-bc2d-3a58e5ec548a","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"304e-9c0f-2068-4d0e"},{"link_uuid":"e1a2c962-c3a2-4754-b3c1-fc0219428537","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"9305-b42c-3262-4c58"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nSplit out of bug 304e-9c0f-2068-4d0e (castoff-tigerseye-ammonite) to avoid widening that fix's\nscope; filed rather than fixed there.\n\n`run_ensures()` (`src/rebar/_store/ensures.py:158`) calls `write_lock()` with the module defaults\n`_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT=30` x `_DEFAULT_ATTEMPTS=2` = a **60 second** acquisition budget, then treats a\n`LockTimeout` as a whole-sweep no-op (it does log a WARNING — it is not silent — but it has already\nburned the 60s by then).\n\n304e fixed the *reclaimability* defect that made one particular lock unprovable forever, so that\nspecific 60s stall is gone. The budget itself is untouched and is a standing fragility: ANY genuinely\ncontended lock — a concurrent writer, a slow push, a genuinely foreign-host lock on a shared\nfilesystem (which is correctly never reclaimed) — still stalls the ensure sweep for a full minute on\na path that runs at boot. The review-bot's autodeploy health check is `HEALTH_TIMEOUT=30`, so a 60s\nbudget on the boot path can fail a deploy on its own, with no orphaned lock involved.\n\n`run_ensures`'s own docstring already anticipates this: \"A caller that must not block (e.g. MCP boot)\npasses a SHORT budget so a contended lock skips the sweep rather than delaying it.\" The MCP boot path\ndoes; the review-bot startup path evidently does not.\n\n## Approach\n\nAudit `run_ensures` callers on startup paths and give the boot-time ones a short bounded budget\n(the sweep is idempotent and re-runs, so skipping it under contention is cheap and safe), or make a\nshort budget the default for the ensure sweep and let the long budget be opt-in. Consider whether\nthe boot path should surface the skip more loudly than a WARNING.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] No startup/boot path can spend more than a few seconds acquiring the write lock for the ensure\n      sweep; verified by a test that holds the lock and asserts the boot path returns promptly.\n- [ ] A skipped sweep is still visible (logged) and still re-runs on the next boot.\n- [ ] The fail-closed StoreIncompatibleError re-raise is unaffected.\n- [ ] make lint, make typecheck, and the default suite exit zero.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["relates_to","9305-b42c-3262-4c58"]],"parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"b83d411f-077d-4ba3-888e-665dbc293cc8","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"e43f-0d14-13f9-408f","ticket_type":"bug","title":"run_ensures uses the full 60s write-lock budget on the boot path, so any contended lock alone can blow a 30s deploy health timeout","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["77021350-9573-4d94-8707-e6aa7d716a70","4e8d7635-5b3d-48eb-bc2d-3a58e5ec548a","e1a2c962-c3a2-4754-b3c1-fc0219428537","b83d411f-077d-4ba3-888e-665dbc293cc8","6d8bf06b-77e0-4eca-800e-1f6d54352f3a"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785551087635965002,"uuid":"f8ac9584-732e-453d-9e65-c43b39f83729"}